{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:52:32+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:52:32+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Lloyds Banking Group plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.lloydsbankinggroup.com","employees":60061,"summary":"Lloyds Banking Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides a range of banking and financial products and services for retail and commercial customers in the United Kingdom. It operates in three segments: Retail; Commercial Banking; and Insurance, Pensions and Investments. The Retail segment offers a range of financial service products, including current accounts, savings, mortgages, credit cards, unsecured loans, motor finance, and leasing solutions to personal customers. Its Commercial Banking segment provides lending, transactional banking, working capital management, debt financing, and risk management services to small and medium businesses, corporates, and institutions. The Insurance, Pensions and Investments segment offers insurance, investment, and pension management products and services. It also provides life assurance; and digital banking services. The company offers its products and services under the Lloyds Bank, Halifax, Bank of Scotland, Scottish Widows, MBNA, Schroders Personal Wealth, Black Horse, Lex Autolease, Birmingham Midshires, LDC, AMC, Embark Group, Lloyds Living, Cavendish Online, Tusker, and HGP brands. The company was formerly known as Lloyds TSB Group plc and changed its name to Lloyds Banking Group plc in January 2009. Lloyds Banking Group plc was founded in 1695 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Lloyds Banking Group plc, avec ses filiales, fournit une gamme de produits et services bancaires et financiers pour les clients de détail et commerciaux au Royaume-Uni. Elle exerce ses activités dans trois secteurs : le commerce de détail, les services bancaires aux entreprises et les assurances, les régimes de retraite et les placements. Le secteur de la vente au détail offre une gamme de produits de services financiers, y compris les comptes courants, l'épargne, les prêts hypothécaires, les cartes de crédit, les prêts non garantis, le financement automobile et les solutions de crédit-bail aux clients personnels."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":56567078912,"shares_outstanding":57335371091,"trailing_pe":12.3325,"forward_pe":8.233332,"price_to_book":138.17928,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":2.891,"dividend_yield":0.039300002,"payout_ratio":0.45630002,"beta_yahoo":0.935},"targets":{"current_price":98.66,"mean":121.105,"median":125.0,"high":140.0,"low":52.999996,"n_analysts":19,"reco_mean":1.94737,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":0.02746,"eps_low":0.02733,"eps_high":0.02759,"revenue_avg":5633373000,"ex_dividend":"2026-08-06","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00053,"institutions_pct":0.51905,"institutions_float_pct":0.51932,"institutions_n":554,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":453230,"value":44715673,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0326},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":840026,"value":82876968,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.013300001,"shares":862408504,"value":85085226162,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0039},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0089,"shares":572492597,"value":56482121716,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0001},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0068,"shares":439367698,"value":43348018693,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.019199999},{"name":"Goldman Sachs TRT II-Goldman Sachs GQG Par